WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.067 --> 00:00:02.901
-Former President Donald Trump,

00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:04.601
the current frontrunner
for the Republican Party's

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.334
presidential nomination in 2024,

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:08.901
called for the Constitution
to be terminated

00:00:08.901 --> 00:00:11.934
after expressing support for the
January 6th insurrectionists

00:00:11.934 --> 00:00:15.000
and now, the Republican Party
has finally come out

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.601
in full force to condemn Trump

00:00:16.601 --> 00:00:18.067
and oust him from the party
and --

00:00:18.067 --> 00:00:19.167
Oh, sorry, what's that?

00:00:19.167 --> 00:00:20.234
They haven't condemned him?

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:21.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:21.934 --> 00:00:23.033
Why not?

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:25.300
Oh, for all the usual reasons?

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:26.033
Well, that's fun.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:27.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.934 --> 00:00:29.634
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:33.667
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:34.901
Well...

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.133
we've been
off since Thanksgiving

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:37.801
and a lot has happened,
but, by far,

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:40.400
the most important thing
that has happened is

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.734
that Wally's sponge
is back, baby!

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:44.133
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:44.133 --> 00:00:45.834
That's right.

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:48.067
Thanks to a winter uptick
in COVID cases,

00:00:48.067 --> 00:00:49.701
our crew is, once again, masked,

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:52.901
which means Wally needs
to reattach his face sponge,

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:54.334
which serves the purpose

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:56.934
of keeping his fingers moist
between cue cards,

00:00:56.934 --> 00:00:59.334
[ Laughter ]
a job his tongue
can no longer do

00:00:59.334 --> 00:01:02.000
because his tongue is
behind a mask.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.701
Now, I actually learned
this exciting sponge news

00:01:04.701 --> 00:01:06.334
thanks to a tweet
from an eagle-eyed viewer

00:01:06.334 --> 00:01:09.234
[ Laughter ]
who saw the face sponge attached

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:12.400
during last Saturday's "SNL,"
a show Wally also works for.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.467
"That eagle-eyed viewer?"
you may ask.

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:15.567
Wally!

00:01:15.567 --> 00:01:18.701
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.100
So, just to be clear --

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:26.567
Wally tweeted a video
of himself

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:27.934
to me and Sal,

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:30.834
in the hopes that we would
put him in "A Closer Look,"

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:31.901
and the worst part is?

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:33.667
It [bleep] worked.

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:34.534
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:35.534
But it didn't work all the way.

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:36.734
No...

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:38.501
it didn't work all the way.

00:01:38.501 --> 00:01:41.267
Because Wally only
gets paid extra if he has a line

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:43.167
and we ain't giving him
a line today, baby!

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:45.267
-Actually, Seth, Seth!
-What?! What?! What?!

00:01:45.267 --> 00:01:47.667
-Nothing. "Actually, Seth" is
just enough to get me paid.

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:49.801
[ Laughter ]

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:52.667
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.567
-You're my Grinch!

00:01:57.567 --> 00:01:59.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:01.167
Believe it or not,
there is other news.

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:03.968
For example,
MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell --

00:02:03.968 --> 00:02:06.267
or as I call him,
America's Wally --

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:08.367
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:10.367
...announced that he is running
for chair

00:02:10.367 --> 00:02:11.901
of the Republican
National Committee,

00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:15.200
which, if he wins, would put him
in charge of the GOP.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:19.434
-MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell
says he plans to run to be

00:02:19.434 --> 00:02:23.033
the chairman of the
Republican National Committee.

00:02:23.033 --> 00:02:26.167
Lindell said he was,
"100% running,"

00:02:26.167 --> 00:02:29.501
during an interview
with Trump ally Steve Bannon.

00:02:29.501 --> 00:02:32.334
The post is currently held
by Ronna McDaniel.

00:02:32.334 --> 00:02:35.434
-I am 100% running
for the RNC chairman

00:02:35.434 --> 00:02:37.200
against Ronna McDaniel.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.300
100%.

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:39.667
I'm all-in, Steve.

00:02:39.667 --> 00:02:41.868
And one of the things said --

00:02:41.868 --> 00:02:43.901
one of the big donors said
to me,

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:45.167
he said, "Mike," he said,

00:02:45.167 --> 00:02:48.167
"Everybody wants you
to be head of the RNC.

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:50.133
Some of them just
don't know it yet."

00:02:50.133 --> 00:02:52.067
-I mean, I'd say he dreamt
that conversation,

00:02:52.067 --> 00:02:53.400
but that meant he fell asleep,

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:55.133
which, one,
he seems incapable of,

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:57.234
and two, is impossible
using a MyPillow.

00:02:57.234 --> 00:03:00.534
[ Laughter ]
The only way Lindell
ever got a solid eight hours is

00:03:00.534 --> 00:03:02.200
if he used a TheirPillow.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.234
[ Laughter ]

00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:06.133
When he says
one of the big donors,

00:03:06.133 --> 00:03:08.868
is he referring to a Republican
donor or an organ donor?

00:03:08.868 --> 00:03:10.567
[ Laughter ]
[ As Lindell ]
I got a third lung installed,

00:03:10.567 --> 00:03:12.934
so I could scream even louder
without taking a breath

00:03:12.934 --> 00:03:16.467
and the big lung donor told me
I should be in charge of the RNC

00:03:16.467 --> 00:03:17.734
right before they
put him under.

00:03:17.734 --> 00:03:19.501
I think they gave him
too much morphine, though,

00:03:19.501 --> 00:03:20.934
because he never woke up.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.968
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:22.968 --> 00:03:25.801
Now, if he does, indeed, run,
Lindell would obviously focus

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:28.100
on his deranged election
conspiracy theories.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.767
For example,
he's still going around

00:03:29.767 --> 00:03:32.834
claiming the midterms
were stolen from Republicans.

00:03:32.834 --> 00:03:34.300
-These machines, when they knew

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:35.734
that they were going to vote
same-day,

00:03:35.734 --> 00:03:37.400
we said,
right here on "FrankSpeech,"

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.234
everybody vote same-day

00:03:39.234 --> 00:03:40.901
because it's harder
for them to cheat,

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:43.400
so, we could overrun
the algorithms.

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:45.501
Well, when you took
those machines down in --

00:03:45.501 --> 00:03:49.000
down in Arizona, you say,
"Put the ballot in the box.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.033
Put the ballot in the box."

00:03:51.033 --> 00:03:52.901
[ Laughter ]
Those ballots got mixed in

00:03:52.901 --> 00:03:54.734
with other ballots, too,
by the way.

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:57.801
They basically became
mail-in ballots, everybody.

00:03:57.801 --> 00:03:59.667
[ Laughter ]
And you know what we do
with mail-in ballots?

00:04:01.534 --> 00:04:02.868
[ Laughter ]
Pull names from the
[indistinct].

00:04:02.868 --> 00:04:06.300
Joe Schmo, Johnny Bananas,
Sue Smith, whatever.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:06.968
-Alright.

00:04:06.968 --> 00:04:09.000
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.467
We've had a good time
with Mike Lindell

00:04:10.467 --> 00:04:12.033
over the years, but,

00:04:12.033 --> 00:04:13.734
at some point,
it stops being funny,

00:04:13.734 --> 00:04:15.834
so, let me say,
with all seriousness,

00:04:15.834 --> 00:04:18.300
you leave Johnny Bananas
out of this!

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:21.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:21.267 --> 00:04:23.767
You think he's had it easy,

00:04:23.767 --> 00:04:26.000
going through life with the name
Johnny Bananas?

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.234
You think that's a fun trip
to the DMV?

00:04:29.234 --> 00:04:32.133
[ Laughter ]
A good icebreaker
for a job interview?

00:04:32.133 --> 00:04:35.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.334 --> 00:04:37.234
You know how many times
his friends

00:04:37.234 --> 00:04:39.100
have set Johnny Bananas up
on blind dates,

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:40.501
only for him
to show up to the restaurant

00:04:40.501 --> 00:04:42.901
and see, not a human woman
at his table,

00:04:42.901 --> 00:04:44.133
but a monkey...

00:04:44.133 --> 00:04:45.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:46.534
...in lipstick and a dress?

00:04:46.534 --> 00:04:48.367
A monkey who his friends
have taught to wave,

00:04:48.367 --> 00:04:50.701
so everyone at the restaurant is
looking when the hostess says,

00:04:50.701 --> 00:04:52.667
"Right this way, Mr. Bananas."

00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:55.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:57.634 --> 00:04:59.400
Sue Smith, on the other hand,
she can [bleep] right off.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:00.267
That's not a real name.

00:05:00.267 --> 00:05:03.400
[ Laughter ]

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:04.834
Also, what is Lindell
miming here?

00:05:04.834 --> 00:05:06.834
-You know what we do
with mail-in ballots?

00:05:07.801 --> 00:05:09.434
[ Laughter ]

00:05:09.434 --> 00:05:11.334
-It looks like
he's milking a giant cow?

00:05:11.334 --> 00:05:12.734
[ Laughter ]

00:05:12.734 --> 00:05:14.300
Either that, or he's climbing
a tree, like...

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.567
-Johnny Bananas.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:15.567 --> 00:05:17.300
-It's obviously very unlikely
that Lindell wins,

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:19.167
but his bid for RNC chair comes
at a time

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:20.834
when Republicans are
figuring out what to do

00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:22.467
with the MyPillow wing
of the Republican Party,

00:05:22.467 --> 00:05:24.534
a wing that includes
their standard bearer

00:05:24.534 --> 00:05:26.567
and current presidential
frontrunner Donald Trump.

00:05:26.567 --> 00:05:29.200
Almost as if he was trying
to outdo Lindell,

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.133
Trump took to his social media
site True Social

00:05:31.133 --> 00:05:32.367
over the weekend and called

00:05:32.367 --> 00:05:34.200
for the Constitution
to be torn up,

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:36.467
so that he could immediately
be reinstated as president.

00:05:36.467 --> 00:05:37.934
-Former President Donald Trump
wrote

00:05:37.934 --> 00:05:40.400
on his social media platform
this weekend.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:41.834
He says...

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.033
-First of all, I like that
he started with the question,

00:05:58.033 --> 00:06:00.868
"do you throw the" results out,
"or do you have a NEW ELECTION,"

00:06:00.868 --> 00:06:03.234
like those are the only
two choices.

00:06:03.234 --> 00:06:04.734
[ Laughter ]
He's like a five-year-old

00:06:04.734 --> 00:06:06.133
who tells his parents,
"Okay, guys,

00:06:06.133 --> 00:06:08.667
should we have ice cream
for dinner or...

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:10.667
should we have cake?
I...

00:06:10.667 --> 00:06:12.267
[ Laughter ]

00:06:12.267 --> 00:06:14.267
I see arguments on both sides."

00:06:14.267 --> 00:06:16.167
[ Laughter ]
But I also appreciate

00:06:16.167 --> 00:06:20.100
he left no room for ambiguity
by using the word termination.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.234
I mean, that's pretty explicit.

00:06:21.234 --> 00:06:22.667
Republicans can't say
he misspoke,

00:06:22.667 --> 00:06:25.234
although, I'm sure the
Ted Cruzes the world will try.

00:06:25.234 --> 00:06:27.467
[ As Cruz ]
The woke mob wants
to destroy Donald Trump

00:06:27.467 --> 00:06:29.000
just because his autocorrect
changed...

00:06:30.968 --> 00:06:32.567
...to...

00:06:32.567 --> 00:06:34.801
[ Laughter ]
Also, I like when Trump tries

00:06:34.801 --> 00:06:36.033
to use what he thinks sounds

00:06:36.033 --> 00:06:37.434
like sophisticated
legal language

00:06:37.434 --> 00:06:39.234
and, instead, just sounds
like an insane person.

00:06:39.234 --> 00:06:40.701
He thinks if he uses big words,

00:06:40.701 --> 00:06:43.434
like "termination of all rules,
regulations, and articles,"

00:06:43.434 --> 00:06:45.901
everyone will think what
he's suggesting is legal.

00:06:45.901 --> 00:06:48.267
He sounds like a college
sophomore in a Starbucks,

00:06:48.267 --> 00:06:50.300
writing a screenplay
for a sci-fi movie.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.934
[ Laughter ]
"Exterior space.

00:06:51.934 --> 00:06:53.200
It's the year 3000.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:56.300
Nuclear war with an army
of sentient voting machines

00:06:56.300 --> 00:06:57.434
has resulted in the termination

00:06:57.434 --> 00:06:59.167
of all rules, regulations,
and articles.

00:06:59.167 --> 00:07:02.100
[ Laughter ]
The galaxy's only hope
for survival rests

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:04.501
with a heroic astronaut,
Captain...

00:07:04.501 --> 00:07:05.467
-Johnny Bananas.

00:07:05.467 --> 00:07:07.133
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:07:07.133 --> 00:07:09.100
That's two.

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:11.234
[ Cheering ]

00:07:11.234 --> 00:07:13.033
That's two
Johnny Bananas callbacks.

00:07:13.033 --> 00:07:14.934
If I were you,

00:07:14.934 --> 00:07:16.634
I wouldn't wait around
for a third.

00:07:16.634 --> 00:07:18.267
[ Laughter ]

00:07:18.267 --> 00:07:20.133
Can't be done.

00:07:20.133 --> 00:07:21.767
Trump's screed calling
for the termination

00:07:21.767 --> 00:07:24.534
of the Constitution came
[ Laughing ] after Twitter --

00:07:24.534 --> 00:07:27.400
after Twitter CEO Elon Musk
released a big dud

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:29.200
he called the Twitter Files,
which was supposed

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:31.767
to be some kind of
Hunter Biden smoking gun,

00:07:31.767 --> 00:07:33.200
but, in reality,
was just a bunch

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:36.267
of internal Twitter emails
about content moderation.

00:07:36.267 --> 00:07:38.367
-Trump's cries to terminate
the Constitution came

00:07:38.367 --> 00:07:42.267
after Elon Musk promoted a new
release of the Twitter Files --

00:07:42.267 --> 00:07:45.467
internal emails showing
how the Trump White House

00:07:45.467 --> 00:07:49.501
and the Biden campaign requested
and received removals

00:07:49.501 --> 00:07:52.334
from certain content
on social media.

00:07:52.334 --> 00:07:53.367
The former journalist

00:07:53.367 --> 00:07:55.567
who compiled those notes
for Musk claimed,

00:07:55.567 --> 00:07:57.467
"One executive would write
to another:

00:07:57.467 --> 00:07:59.767
'More to review
from the Biden team.'

00:07:59.767 --> 00:08:02.234
The reply would come back:
'Handled.'"

00:08:02.234 --> 00:08:04.200
But reviews
of Internet Archive show

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:08.067
those links were explicit
pornographic images stolen

00:08:08.067 --> 00:08:10.200
from Hunter Biden's
laptop hard drive,

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.133
not requests
from the Biden campaign

00:08:12.133 --> 00:08:14.868
to suppress The New York Post
story itself.

00:08:14.868 --> 00:08:17.400
-Yes, Trump wants
the Constitution terminated

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.634
because Joe Biden's campaign,

00:08:18.634 --> 00:08:20.133
which was not the government
in 2020,

00:08:20.133 --> 00:08:23.033
asked Twitter to take down pics
of Hunter Biden's dong.

00:08:23.033 --> 00:08:24.734
[ Laughter ]
I'm sorry, but I don't think

00:08:24.734 --> 00:08:26.868
there's a provision for that
in the Constitution.

00:08:26.868 --> 00:08:28.267
I don't remember
Alexander Hamilton

00:08:28.267 --> 00:08:30.267
ever writing, in the
Federalist Papers, that,

00:08:30.267 --> 00:08:32.234
"The Constitution shall be
the law of the land,

00:08:32.234 --> 00:08:34.734
unless John Adams' son posts
a lithographed flyer

00:08:34.734 --> 00:08:36.167
of his genitals
in Faneuil Hall."

00:08:36.167 --> 00:08:37.334
[ Laughter ]

00:08:37.334 --> 00:08:38.701
Interesting historical fact --

00:08:38.701 --> 00:08:41.901
John Adams son John Quincy Adams
was also president,

00:08:41.901 --> 00:08:43.968
but later in life,
they had a falling out,

00:08:43.968 --> 00:08:47.334
so, John Quincy Adams had
his name legally changed to...

00:08:47.334 --> 00:08:48.300
-Johnny Bananas.

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:50.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:50.734 --> 00:08:51.400
-There we go.

00:08:51.400 --> 00:08:54.133
[ Cheering ]

00:08:56.734 --> 00:08:58.767
And I am certain
that's the end of that.

00:08:58.767 --> 00:09:01.901
[ Laughter ]

00:09:04.167 --> 00:09:06.067
These guys are desperate to find
secret evidence

00:09:06.067 --> 00:09:08.200
of a hidden conspiracy in the
laptop of the president's son.

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.834
Meanwhile,
Trump's out there admitting

00:09:09.834 --> 00:09:11.934
he stole classified documents
from the White House

00:09:11.934 --> 00:09:13.100
and they're all like, "So what?

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:14.601
We all still stuff from work."

00:09:14.601 --> 00:09:16.767
What is it about the words
Hunter Biden's laptop

00:09:16.767 --> 00:09:18.400
that drives right-wingers
absolutely insane?

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.934
It's all they can think about.

00:09:19.934 --> 00:09:21.834
It's like that torture device
they make Bix wear in "Andor."

00:09:21.834 --> 00:09:24.367
They just hear those three words
and they lose their minds.

00:09:24.367 --> 00:09:26.834
Also, side note --
"Andor" rules!

00:09:26.834 --> 00:09:29.300
[ Cheering and applause ]
Flat-out rules!

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:30.701
[ Laughter ]
And I'm not one of those people
who loves everything

00:09:30.701 --> 00:09:32.634
about "Star Wars."
I'm an adult!

00:09:32.634 --> 00:09:33.767
[ Laughter ]
Okay?

00:09:33.767 --> 00:09:35.167
At some point,
you get too old for movies

00:09:35.167 --> 00:09:36.267
where everyone has a crazy name,

00:09:36.267 --> 00:09:38.234
like Kylo Ren or Poe Dameron
or...

00:09:38.234 --> 00:09:39.234
-Johnny Bananas.

00:09:39.234 --> 00:09:41.033
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Although,

00:09:41.033 --> 00:09:43.334
I do get chills --

00:09:43.334 --> 00:09:45.968
I do get chills every time
I remember

00:09:45.968 --> 00:09:47.667
that famous line, "Help me..."

00:09:47.667 --> 00:09:48.434
-Johnny Bananas.

00:09:48.434 --> 00:09:49.534
-"...you're my only hope."

00:09:49.534 --> 00:09:50.501
[ Laughter ]
Anyway.

00:09:55.801 --> 00:09:58.601
The point is the rule of five
is an effective comedy device

00:09:58.601 --> 00:10:02.300
[ Laughter ]
and also, even after the GOP
was repudiated in the midterms,

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.000
they're still leaning
even further

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:05.501
in the direction
of MAGA extremism.

00:10:05.501 --> 00:10:07.100
For example,
right before he called

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:08.467
for the termination
of the Constitution,

00:10:08.467 --> 00:10:11.400
Trump also recorded
a video message in support --

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:13.734
in support -- of the January 6th
insurrectionists,

00:10:13.734 --> 00:10:16.601
even after the leader of the
Oath Keepers, Stewart Rhodes,

00:10:16.601 --> 00:10:18.601
was convicted
of seditious conspiracy.

00:10:18.601 --> 00:10:21.067
-Patriot freedom
is what it's about

00:10:21.067 --> 00:10:23.834
and that's not happening
in our country.

00:10:23.834 --> 00:10:27.267
What they've done
to torment people

00:10:27.267 --> 00:10:29.767
and go after people
like never before,

00:10:29.767 --> 00:10:31.267
I don't think anything like this

00:10:31.267 --> 00:10:33.801
has ever happened
in our country before,

00:10:33.801 --> 00:10:35.601
certainly not to this extent.

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:38.133
So, it's a very
unfair situation

00:10:38.133 --> 00:10:40.300
and we're going to be,
as you know,

00:10:40.300 --> 00:10:42.501
looking about it
and talking about it

00:10:42.501 --> 00:10:45.767
very, very strongly
in the coming weeks, months,

00:10:45.767 --> 00:10:49.000
and over the next period
of a year, year and a half,

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.634
during the campaign.

00:10:50.634 --> 00:10:53.100
People have been treated
unconstitutionally,

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:56.467
in my opinion,
and very, very unfairly

00:10:56.467 --> 00:10:58.868
and we're going to get
to the bottom of it.

00:10:58.868 --> 00:11:00.634
-Content aside,

00:11:00.634 --> 00:11:02.634
why is he standing so far away?

00:11:02.634 --> 00:11:05.601
[ Laughter ]

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.567
Is he recording this
on a Mar-A-Lago security camera?

00:11:10.567 --> 00:11:11.501
[ Laughter ]

00:11:11.501 --> 00:11:12.534
Is he shrinking?

00:11:12.534 --> 00:11:14.133
I don't know.

00:11:14.133 --> 00:11:16.200
But that is exactly the kind
of rumor Donald Trump

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:17.868
would spread about that video
of Donald Trump.

00:11:17.868 --> 00:11:19.267
[ As Trump ]
Have you seen that video
of Donald Trump?

00:11:19.267 --> 00:11:20.667
They're saying he shrunk.
He's tiny now.

00:11:20.667 --> 00:11:21.834
They're calling him Tiny Trump.

00:11:21.834 --> 00:11:23.400
[ Laughter ]
Many people are saying

00:11:23.400 --> 00:11:26.534
it's so sad he's 3'0", 2'0",
perhaps even 1'0" tall.

00:11:26.534 --> 00:11:28.000
[ Laughter ]

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.667
He reminds me a lot
of Hermey the Elf.

00:11:29.667 --> 00:11:31.934
[ Laughter ]
Great elf, tough elf.

00:11:31.934 --> 00:11:33.234
I met him once.
He came up to me,

00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:34.734
tears pouring down his face

00:11:34.734 --> 00:11:36.434
and then freezing
to the side of his cheek

00:11:36.434 --> 00:11:37.968
and he said to me, "Sir,

00:11:37.968 --> 00:11:39.434
I just want to be a dentist."

00:11:39.434 --> 00:11:42.868
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:42.868 --> 00:11:45.567
Also, I've notice that Trump has
a new move with his hands.

00:11:45.567 --> 00:11:48.801
They're like,
instead of doing up here,

00:11:48.801 --> 00:11:50.801
he's started doing them
like down here.

00:11:50.801 --> 00:11:52.467
[ Laughter ]
I guess that's why they had

00:11:52.467 --> 00:11:54.200
to move the camera back.
He said --

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:56.033
[ As Trump ]
I do my hands down here now.

00:11:56.033 --> 00:11:58.901
[ Laughter ]
And they said,
"Alright, but they're going

00:11:58.901 --> 00:12:00.467
to be out of frame."
And he was like --

00:12:00.467 --> 00:12:01.934
[ As Trump ]
Well, then you got to back
the camera up!

00:12:01.934 --> 00:12:03.367
[ Laughter ]

00:12:03.367 --> 00:12:05.334
The hands are up, people know
I'm not [bleep] crazy.

00:12:05.334 --> 00:12:07.267
[ Laughter ]
With the hands --

00:12:07.267 --> 00:12:08.467
With the hands, I look smart.

00:12:08.467 --> 00:12:09.601
Without them, I look like I'm...

00:12:09.601 --> 00:12:10.367
-Sue Smith.

00:12:10.367 --> 00:12:11.133
-Oh.

00:12:11.133 --> 00:12:14.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.667
Didn't see that one coming,
did you?

00:12:17.667 --> 00:12:19.300
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.033
When you think I'm going to zig,
I zag!

00:12:21.033 --> 00:12:22.834
[ Laughter ]
That's why they call me...

00:12:22.834 --> 00:12:23.767
-Johnny Bananas.

00:12:23.767 --> 00:12:25.467
-Yep.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:12:25.467 --> 00:12:26.234
Six.

00:12:26.234 --> 00:12:29.200
[ Cheering ]

00:12:32.167 --> 00:12:35.300
And, yet, even after all that,
Republicans still can't seem

00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:37.534
to bring themselves
to oust Trump from their party.

00:12:37.534 --> 00:12:41.300
Yesterday, George Stephanopoulos
asked GOP Congressman Dave Joyce

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:43.467
about Trump's call to terminate
the Constitution

00:12:43.467 --> 00:12:45.767
and Joyce still said
he would support Trump

00:12:45.767 --> 00:12:47.234
for president in 2024.

00:12:47.234 --> 00:12:49.167
-Can you support a candidate
in 2024

00:12:49.167 --> 00:12:51.000
who's for suspending
the Constitution?

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:52.868
-Well, again, it's early.
I think there's going to be

00:12:52.868 --> 00:12:54.167
a lot of people in the primary.

00:12:54.167 --> 00:12:57.167
I think, at the end of the day,
you'll --

00:12:57.167 --> 00:12:58.534
whoever the Republican
then to pick,

00:12:58.534 --> 00:13:00.300
I'll fall in behind
because that's --

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:01.767
-Even if it's Donald Trump

00:13:01.767 --> 00:13:03.634
and he's called for suspending
the Constitution?

00:13:03.634 --> 00:13:05.834
-Well, again, I think it's going
to be a big field.

00:13:05.834 --> 00:13:07.567
I don't think Donald Trump's
going to clear out the field

00:13:07.567 --> 00:13:09.467
like he did in '16.
-That's not what I'm asking.

00:13:09.467 --> 00:13:12.501
I'm asking, if he's the nominee,
will you support him?

00:13:12.501 --> 00:13:14.801
-I will support whoever
the Republican nominee is.

00:13:14.801 --> 00:13:16.067
-That's a remarkable statement.

00:13:16.067 --> 00:13:17.300
You'd support a candidate

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:19.801
who's come out for suspending
the Constitution?

00:13:19.801 --> 00:13:22.200
-Well, you know,
he says a lot of things.

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:24.234
-But that's
an extraordinary statement.

00:13:24.234 --> 00:13:25.534
You can't come out
against someone

00:13:25.534 --> 00:13:27.801
who's for suspending
the Constitution?

00:13:27.801 --> 00:13:30.133
-Well, first off,
he has no ability

00:13:30.133 --> 00:13:31.701
to suspend the Constitution.

00:13:31.701 --> 00:13:33.534
Secondly --
-But he says he's for it.

00:13:33.534 --> 00:13:36.601
-Well, you know,
he says a lot of things that --

00:13:36.601 --> 00:13:39.200
[ Laughter ]
But that doesn't mean that it's
ever going to happen.

00:13:39.200 --> 00:13:40.734
-Well, that's reassuring.

00:13:40.734 --> 00:13:41.767
[ Laughter ]

00:13:41.767 --> 00:13:43.467
Trump wants to terminate
the Constitution,

00:13:43.467 --> 00:13:44.934
but he can't,
so, don't worry about it.

00:13:44.934 --> 00:13:46.734
It's kind of like how,
in every Bond movie,

00:13:46.734 --> 00:13:49.000
M explains the villain's plans
to blow up the UN

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:51.834
and Bond says, "I'm sorry,
you mean this Austrian dork?

00:13:51.834 --> 00:13:53.133
I doubt he's
blowing up anything,

00:13:53.133 --> 00:13:54.834
unless it's in a game
of Minecraft."

00:13:54.834 --> 00:13:56.367
[ Laughter ]
You'd think calling

00:13:56.367 --> 00:13:58.033
for the termination
of the Constitution

00:13:58.033 --> 00:13:59.400
would finally be the last straw,

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:01.300
but there will never be
a last straw for Republicans.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:04.534
No matter how many times voters
repudiate Trump's extremism,

00:14:04.534 --> 00:14:06.334
Republicans can't seem
to pry themselves away.

00:14:06.334 --> 00:14:08.667
They're just hoping
someone else runs against him,

00:14:08.667 --> 00:14:10.334
so, instead of getting asked,
"If he's the nominee,

00:14:10.334 --> 00:14:12.100
will you support Donald Trump?"
They'll get asked...

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:13.400
-If he's the nominee,
will you support...

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:14.467
-Johnny Bananas.

00:14:14.467 --> 00:14:16.434
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:14:16.434 --> 00:14:17.100
-I don't know.

00:14:20.234 --> 00:14:21.534
I don't know, Sal.
At some point,

00:14:21.534 --> 00:14:22.968
you just can't call it back
that many times.

00:14:22.968 --> 00:14:27.267
[ Laughter ]

00:14:27.267 --> 00:14:29.434
Just like you got --
It's moderation, Sal.

00:14:29.434 --> 00:14:32.667
[ Laughter ]

00:14:32.667 --> 00:14:34.067
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:14:34.067 --> 00:14:37.801
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

